b><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3F\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml display=\"inline\" unselectable=\"on\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>?</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyHard\">H</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Sat, Oct 17th @ 1:58 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:20</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: red;\">Incorrect</span></span></div></div>",
