  "canonical_examples": [
    {
      "dom_id": "step-33933",
      "name": "Example: \n                    Finding the Distribution of a Sum or Difference of Normal Random Variables",
      "problem": "If $X_1\\sim N(2,5)$ and $X_2\\sim  N(-2, 2)$ are independent, then what is the distribution of $Y = X_1+X_2?$",
      "worked_solution": "Recall that if $X_1$ and $X_2$ are independent random variables, where $X_1\\sim N(\\mu_1,\\sigma^2_1)$ and $X_2\\sim N(\\mu_2,\\sigma^2_2),$ then \n\n$$\nY = X_1+X_2\\sim N(\\mu_1+\\mu_2, \\sigma^2_1+\\sigma^2_2).\n$$\n\nSince $X_1$ and $X_2$ are independent, we have \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Y={X}_{1}+{X}_{2} & ∼N(2+(-2),5+2) \\\\  & ∼N(0,7).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $Y\\sim N(0, 7).$",
      "html": "<div id=\"step-33933\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"33933\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"9103\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-33933\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-2\">Finding the Distribution of a Sum or Difference of Normal Random Variables</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"33933\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            