"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E9-MJMAIN-30\" x=\"3375\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E9-MJMAIN-2C\" x=\"3876\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E9-MJMAIN-37\" x=\"4321\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E9-MJMAIN-29\" x=\"4821\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E9-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"5211\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n\n            </div>           \n        </div>",
      "html_path": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14275528/observations/lesson-step-33933-94d1d0b2a10aaf56c34c.html",
