    {
      "dom_id": "step-33983",
      "name": "Example: \n                    Finding the Distribution of a Sum or Difference of Scaled Normal Random Variables",
      "problem": "Suppose that $X$ and $Y$ are independent random variables such that $X \\sim N(2,7)$ and $Y \\sim  N(5, 4).$ Find the distribution of the random variable $W = 2X-Y.$",
      "worked_solution": "Recall that if $X_1$ and $X_2$ are independent random variables, where $X_1\\sim N(\\mu_1,\\sigma^2_1)$ and $X_2\\sim N(\\mu_2,\\sigma^2_2),$ and $a$ and $b$ are constants, then \n\n$$\naX_1+bX_2\\sim N(a\\mu_1+b\\mu_2, a^2\\sigma^2_1+b^2\\sigma^2_2).\n$$\n\nSince $X$ and $Y$ are independent, we have \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}W=2X-Y & ∼N(2\\cdot 2+(-1)\\cdot 5,{2}^{2}\\cdot 7+(-1)^{2}\\cdot 4) \\\\  & ∼N(-1,32).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $Y\\sim N(-1, 32).$",
      "html": "<div id=\"step-33983\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"33983\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"9117\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-33983\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-6\">Finding the Distribution of a Sum or Difference of Scaled Normal Random Variables</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"33983\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                     