      ],
      "html_path": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14275528/observations/step-e9117-7e3e6dd165f05b12b447.html",
      "screenshot": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14275528/observations/step-e9117-7e3e6dd165f05b12b447.png",
      "worked_solution": "Recall that if $X_1$ and $X_2$ are independent random variables, where $X_1\\sim N(\\mu_1,\\sigma^2_1)$ and $X_2\\sim N(\\mu_2,\\sigma^2_2),$ and $a$ and $b$ are constants, then \n\n$$\naX_1+bX_2\\sim N(a\\mu_1+b\\mu_2, a^2\\sigma^2_1+b^2\\sigma^2_2).\n$$\n\nSince $X$ and $Y$ are independent, we have \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}W=2X-Y & ∼N(2\\cdot 2+(-1)\\cdot 5,{2}^{2}\\cdot 7+(-1)^{2}\\cdot 4) \\\\  & ∼N(-1,32).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $Y\\sim N(-1, 32).$",
      "can_dont_know": false,
      "can_skip": false,
      "question": {
        "dom_id": "step-e9117",
        "name": "Example: Finding the Distribution of a Sum or Difference of Scaled Normal Random Variables",
        "problem": "Suppose that $X$ and $Y$ are independent random variables such that $X \\sim N(2,7)$ and $Y \\sim  N(5, 4).$ Find the distribution of the random variable $W = 2X-Y.$",
        "worked_solution": "Recall that if $X_1$ and $X_2$ are independent random variables, where $X_1\\sim N(\\mu_1,\\sigma^2_1)$ and $X_2\\sim N(\\mu_2,\\sigma^2_2),$ and $a$ and $b$ are constants, then \n\n$$\naX_1+bX_2\\sim N(a\\mu_1+b\\mu_2, a^2\\sigma^2_1+b^2\\sigma^2_2).\n$$\n\nSince $X$ and $Y$ are independent, we have \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}W=2X-Y & ∼N(2\\cdot 2+(-1)\\cdot 5,{2}^{2}\\cdot 7+(-1)^{2}\\cdot 4) \\\\  & ∼N(-1,32).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $Y\\sim N(-1, 32).$",
        "calculator_instructions": "",
        "fields": [],
        "problem_field_keys": [],
        "answer_fields_complete": null,
        "result": null,
        "proof_feedback": null,
        "html": "<div id=\"step-e9117\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Finding the Distribution of a Sum or Difference of Scaled Normal Random Variables</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e9117\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n                            -webkit-transition: none;\n                            -moz-transition: none;\n                            -ms-transition: none;\n                            -o-transition: none\n                            }\n\n                            .mjx-svg-href {\n                            fill: blue;\n                            stroke: blue\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox {\n                            display: table!important\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox span {\n                            display: table-cell!important;\n                            width: 10000em!important;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage__block {\n                            text-align: center;\n                            margin: 1em 0em;\n                            position: relative;\n                            display: block!important;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            width: 100%\n                            }</style><p>Suppose that <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.98ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 852.5 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">X</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMATHI-58\" d=