      "solution": {
        "status": "ambiguous",
        "reasoning": "Independence gives Y a normal distribution with mean 2(10)-3(5)=5 and variance 2^2(4^2)+(-3)^2(2^2)=100, so its standard deviation is 10. Therefore P(Y≥10)=1-Φ((10-5)/10)=1-0.6915=0.3085, which rounds to 0.31, choice e. No captured MA answer or grade establishes this question's key; the worked example concerns a different question.",
        "confidence": 1,
