      "solution": {
        "status": "ambiguous",
        "reasoning": "Independence gives Y a normal distribution with mean 20-2=18 and variance 200+25=225, so its standard deviation is 15. Hence P(Y>1.8)=1-Φ((1.8-18)/15)=1-Φ(-1.08)=1-0.1401=0.8599, which rounds to 0.86, choice b. No captured MA answer or grade establishes this question's key; the worked example concerns a different question.",
        "confidence": 1,
        "answers": [
          {
            "key": "selection",
