      "solution": {
        "status": "ambiguous",
        "reasoning": "Independence gives Y a normal distribution with mean 9-2(4)=1 and variance 8+(-2)^2(2)=16, so its standard deviation is 4. Thus P(Y≤4)=Φ((4-1)/4)=Φ(0.75)=0.7734, which rounds to 0.77, choice b. No captured MA answer or grade establishes this question's key; the worked example concerns a different question.",
        "confidence": 1,
        "answers": [
