        "reasoning": "Independence gives Y a normal distribution with mean 5(2)-7=3 and variance 5^2(3)+(-1)^2(25)=100, so its standard deviation is 10. Therefore P(Y>20)=1-Φ((20-3)/10)=1-Φ(1.7)=1-0.9554=0.0446, which rounds to 0.04, choice e. No captured MA answer or grade establishes this question's key; the worked example concerns a different question.",
        "confidence": 1,
        "answers": [
          {
