      "solution": {
        "status": "ambiguous",
        "reasoning": "The total weight is normal with mean 340+25=365 and variance 4+1=5. Thus P(W>360)=1-\\Phi((360-365)/\\sqrt{5}). Rounding the z-score to -2.24 and using the supplied table gives 1-0.0125=0.9875, choice b. This table approximation follows the example's method. No captured MA answer or grade establishes this question's key.",
        "confidence": 1,
        "answers": [
          {
