      "solution": {
        "status": "ambiguous",
        "reasoning": "The cooked total S=2C+3P is normal with mean 2(57)+3(42)=240 and variance 2^2(2^2)+3^2(1^2)=25, so its standard deviation is 5. Therefore P(240<S<250)=\\Phi(2)-\\Phi(0)=0.9772-0.5=0.4772, choice d. No captured MA answer or grade establishes this question's key; the worked example concerns a different question.",
        "confidence": 1,
